  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Road Spring 2008, the last Battle Road, was planned for five venues but held only at the Sapporo Park Hotel on 23 March and ATC Hall in Osaka on 30 March 2008: The Pokémon Company canceled the rest after a letter threatened to disrupt the Kanto tournament, and no summer circuit followed. Visitors got Magnezone, players Dusknoir, finalists the cosmos holo Supporter Cynthia's Feelings, and the top two of both blocks in each division Miracle Diamond. Side events gave Buck's Training to the Heatran vs. Regigigas One Day Battle and the Turtwig, Chimchar and Piplup class cards to children at the First Classroom DP. In place of the canceled events, Magnezone, Dusknoir and Pikachu were sent to everyone who applied for the official fan club's free card by 2 June 2008.",
